{"abstract":[{"text":"What Gale and Shapley’s deferred acceptance reports, in order, as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stableMatching"},{"text":" runs it.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/matchingmodule\/galeshapleyevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GaleShapleyEvent"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Free proposers are taken from a stack, lowest index first at the start. A free proposer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"proposes to the next reviewer on its list. The reviewer rejects a proposer it does not list or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ranks below the one it holds, accepts when it holds no one, and otherwise trades up, freeing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the proposer it held, who goes on top of the stack. A rejected proposer proposes again; an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepted one waits. A proposer whose list runs out stays unmatched. The pairs held at the end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stableMatching"},{"type":"text","text":"’s matching."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/documentation\/MatchingModule"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/documentation\/MatchingModule\/GaleShapleyEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Matc